# Rust build artifacts (plugin crates have their own target/ dirs)
plugins/*/target/
# Compiled WASM artifacts copied to plugin root by `just build-plugin`
plugins/*/*.wasm
# Packaged plugin archives built by `just package-plugin`
plugins/*.torchsnap

# Test fixture crate build artifacts — each fixture is a
# standalone wasm32-wasip2 crate with its own target/ dir.
# The committed `*.wasm` next to each fixture's Cargo.toml is
# the canonical test input, rebuilt via `just build-test-fixtures`.
src-tauri/tests/fixtures/*/target/

# Generated asset data lives in src/derived/ and IS checked in.
# See src/derived/README.md for regeneration instructions.

# Memory benchmark output
memsnap-*.json
bench-memory-*.json
bench-memory-*.jsonl
*.snapshots.jsonl
memory-benchmark.log

